Comment: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The candy... 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's filling up... 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.63,0:00:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato's wish has changed. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But the contract can't change. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.43,0:00:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She'll go to the place that she wanted to. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.37,0:00:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't a gift, it's a curse! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's happening? 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.59,0:00:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's somewhere I must go. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Farewell. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:15.37,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:17.17,Default,Ho,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.17,0:03:20.02,Default,Se,0000,0000,0000,,Mama wanted us to move this mattress. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:20.96,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,A mattress? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:25.45,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Why was there a mattress in an empty room? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.96,0:03:29.02,Default,Ti,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:31.44,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's helping us move it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:35.20,Default,Ti,0000,0000,0000,,Has your arm healed, Kiyokazu? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:38.28,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. They just want me to take it easy for another month. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:40.82,Default,Ti,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. Thanks. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:42.74,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What are those, Mama? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.74,0:03:46.47,Default,Ti,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I'd try to find a new tenant. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:50.70,Default,Ti,0000,0000,0000,,That room's been empty since even before you moved in, Kiyokazu. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.70,0:03:53.12,Default,Ti,0000,0000,0000,,There should be someone in there to take care of it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:55.00,Default,Ti,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.00,0:03:56.17,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose... 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:03:59.67,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,I go in and air it out every once in a while, 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:02.74,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,so why don't we leave it empty a little longer? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.48,0:04:04.66,Default,Ti,0000,0000,0000,,Why? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.25,0:04:08.06,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:12.20,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, forget I said anything. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:21.90,Default,Do,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't seen you in a while, Kiyokazu. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:26.27,Default,Do,0000,0000,0000,,Have you really been skipping lectures? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.27,0:04:27.10,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:30.07,Default,Do,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you wanted to be a lawyer. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:34.56,Default,Do,0000,0000,0000,,They said you haven't even been taking notes when you do show up. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:35.84,Default,Do,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:38.21,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing in particular. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:41.63,Default,Do,0000,0000,0000,,Something's up with you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:44.18,Default,Do,0000,0000,0000,,Something took the wind out of your sails. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:45.69,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Not really. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.89,0:04:50.72,Default,Do,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it's understandable. You did lose something important to you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:04:56.48,Default,Do,0000,0000,0000,,It's been, what, three months now? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:04:59.15,Default,Do,0000,0000,0000,,It's really too bad what happened to the nursery. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:05.88,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not really worried about that. Just... 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:16.15,Default,Do,0000,0000,0000,,Just...? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.14,0:05:19.16,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Nah... 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:22.44,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.33,0:05:29.86,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:51.72,Default,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,The kids were thinking about Yomogi. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:53.49,Default,Ma,0000,0000,0000,,So we all came to see it! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:59.28,Default,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, I... 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.81,0:06:04.04,Default,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Lately I've been thinking about starting Yomogi Nursery back up. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:11.44,Default,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura says that this time he'll be behind me 100%. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:14.91,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,That's great. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:18.70,Default,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. You take care too, okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.70,0:06:19.60,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:24.82,Default,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm worried about how down you've seemed at school. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:28.03,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto, you{\fscx162}-{\fscx81} 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:33.62,Default,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Once we get everything started back up, why don't you come on a field trip with us? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.02,0:06:36.34,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,That's a great idea. We'll get everyone{\fscx162}-{\fscx81} 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.64,0:06:38.66,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.66,0:06:45.18,Default,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, a field trip with everyone. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:46.96,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, a field trip! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.22,0:06:48.41,Default,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.41,0:06:50.12,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Where are we going!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:51.47,Default,Ma,0000,0000,0000,,I want to go too! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:54.40,Default,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. Let's all go together. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:56.45,Default,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Fujimoto? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:06:59.03,Default,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.03,0:07:01.71,Default,Ma,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone together! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:51.03,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:53.49,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,You meanie! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:55.67,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:57.39,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:08.14,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,What is this!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.71,0:08:16.28,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:10.07,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Why? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.60,0:09:15.55,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Why doesn't anyone remember her!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.40,0:09:30.28,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.10,0:09:33.90,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:43.59,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,You're not here about newspaper delivery again, are you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:49.80,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I remember. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:54.94,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,I can't find anyone who remembers her. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.94,0:09:57.40,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Why can you? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.55,0:10:04.54,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,Is that what you want to ask? Is there anything else? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.18,0:10:09.29,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.14,0:10:16.43,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,When she disappeared, she said there was somewhere she must go. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:18.88,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.91,0:10:23.01,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to hear the truth, you have to promise me 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:27.13,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,that you won't be too shocked by what I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.47,0:10:29.81,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,Okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.41,0:10:33.29,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.33,0:10:45.54,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,Long ago, she lost her life due to something unfortunate that occurred in another world. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.22,0:10:48.27,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Her life? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:52.79,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato's wish... 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.76,0:10:59.54,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,It was to transcend time, and be reborn by the side of her love. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:03.81,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,That's what she wished for. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:08.73,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,And in order for that wish to be granted,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:14.19,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,she was given a task and sent down to earth. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:21.22,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,Her soul had only the span of four seasons... 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.65,0:11:26.12,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Then, she's already... there? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.51,0:11:28.35,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:38.42,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,Over my long, long years with Shuichiro, we've parted in tears so many times. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:41.43,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro... The doctor, right? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.17,0:11:46.73,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,As Shuichiro is reborn... 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:52.53,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. As he is reborn, we meet again. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:54.75,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,Our hearts are drawn together. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.19,0:11:58.79,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,Even if our memories of previous lives are lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.29,0:12:03.11,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,We still bear the same souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:11.26,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,As long as our souls continue to pass on, no matter how many times... 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.02,0:12:13.08,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure we'll meet. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:41.19,Default,Ya,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what I would have done if the machinery at the plant had been foreclosed on. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.19,0:12:43.60,Default,Ya,0000,0000,0000,,I can't thank you enough, Fukita. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:47.11,Default,Ki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad it worked out. Let's keep it up. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.11,0:12:49.11,Default,Ya,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.87,0:12:51.83,Default,Ki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Fujimoto. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:53.00,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Yes? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:57.04,Default,Ki,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you take a look at the file on my desk sometime? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:13:01.11,Default,Ki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be out of the office, so I'd like you to handle it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:02.01,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.{attorney's badge. lol.} 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.41,0:13:04.44,Default,Mt,0000,0000,0000,,It's an inheritance case. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:06.21,Default,Ya,0000,0000,0000,,Who's that? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.21,0:13:09.50,Default,Fk,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you haven't met him yet? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:13.58,Default,Fk,0000,0000,0000,,He's been at my firm for four years now. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.01,0:13:18.68,Default,Fk,0000,0000,0000,,Fukita and Associates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.01,0:13:18.68,Default-kobaalt,Fk,0000,0000,0000,,{alt}He's young, but he works hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:22.32,Default,Mt,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto! It's from Secretary Hattori at the court. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:23.24,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:29.70,Default,Fk,0000,0000,0000,,He was a client of mine who passed recently. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.79,0:13:33.37,Default,Fk,0000,0000,0000,,His son and daughter-in-law had already passed away,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:39.84,Default,Fk,0000,0000,0000,,so in his will of two years ago he specified his granddaughter as the sole heir. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:48.55,Default,Fk,0000,0000,0000,,However, the land is from an old estate, so the exact borders are uncertain. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:52.97,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Understood. I'll go check it out in person tomorrow. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:24.83,Song,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Under the summer sky 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:28.40,Song,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Within my heart 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.51,0:17:33.82,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so you're the lawyer. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.09,0:17:35.96,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Pleased to meet you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.35,0:17:41.55,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Pleased to... meet... you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:48.29,Default,Ha,0000,0000,0000,,Even if our memories of previous lives are lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:49.91,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.58,0:17:52.13,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Stop! Please! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.33,0:17:55.91,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto... 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:17:59.70,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,You're the person I care the most about. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.79,0:18:02.18,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,I always have. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.19,0:18:04.64,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,And I always will. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.21,0:18:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Always...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.44,0:18:09.64,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,The piano... 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.09,0:18:14.71,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,You're good at playing the piano. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.50,0:18:17.95,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for not asking first. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:23.41,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,That's funny, for some reason I feel like I know that melody. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.07,0:18:29.05,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Really? It's a song an old love used to sing. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:32.82,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,I've been looking for her for a long time. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:37.59,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? I hope you find her. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:41.52,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:46.86,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, do you mind if I inspect the house? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:48.02,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Go right ahead. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:53.39,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Everything checks out. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.40,0:18:58.68,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,I just have to go back to the office and clear up the formalities. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.68,0:19:01.36,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Sure! Thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.99,0:19:05.83,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,And... I have to give this back to you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.83,0:19:06.45,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Er? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.32,0:19:11.84,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Candy? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.28,0:19:16.30,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Can you sing that song for me one more time? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:19.56,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Of course! 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:48.38,Song,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,The flowers which bloom in spring, the wide summer sky 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:20:01.88,Song,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Within my heart their shine remains
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.72,0:20:15.43,Song,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Even on days I close my windows to shut out the morning rain
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.44,0:20:27.96,Song,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Fluttering within my heart, the light breaks through the clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.03,0:20:48.43,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.59,0:20:56.58,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,So that was it... 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:03.01,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,The place I wanted to go... 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.51,0:21:07.43,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,The person I wanted to be with... 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.40,0:21:17.36,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,I thought if I had just one more chance, this time we could be happy together. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.38,0:21:23.09,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,I was so silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.54,0:21:24.56,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:29.85,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:35.00,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,You've kept me waiting so many years. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.53,0:21:37.02,Default,Fu,0000,0000,0000,,You're late again. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.29,0:21:43.91,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto! 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.28,0:22:01.38,Song,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Joy and sadness, I embrace them both and keep going
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:15.06,Song,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,My hand and yours join together strongly
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:41.21,Song,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,On the shore in the autumn, in winter, sleeping in the treetops
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.21,0:22:53.97,Song,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,The endless kindness of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.92,0:22:56.55,Default,Ge,0000,0000,0000,,That's all there is to it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.55,0:23:02.90,Default,Ge,0000,0000,0000,,That idiot decides that even after finishing his task he's going to keep protecting her. 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.42,0:23:07.69,Default,Ge,0000,0000,0000,,So he's staying in the human world, and we're stuck making baumkuchen. 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.69,0:23:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.66,0:23:12.04,Default,Zu,0000,0000,0000,,At least baumkuchen's tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.45,0:23:20.12,Default,I,0000,0000,0000,,There we go. 100 points for me. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.18,0:23:07.00,Song,I,0000,0000,0000,,As night falls, let us offer our prayers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.36,0:23:20.33,Song,I,0000,0000,0000,,And silently welcome tomorrow's sun
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.53,0:23:34.74,Song,I,0000,0000,0000,,A faraway voice leads me on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.74,0:23:47.88,Song,I,0000,0000,0000,,Like it's smiling, like it's singing, the echoing sound of the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.88,0:24:00.78,Song,I,0000,0000,0000,,Joy and sadness, I embrace them both and keep going
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.78,0:24:14.59,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,My hand and yours join together strongly
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.98,0:01:29.86,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,What shall I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:38.16,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.16,0:01:47.96,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.46,0:01:53.75,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.76,0:02:01.51,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.51,0:02:07.18,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.18,0:02:12.40,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.40,0:02:18.70,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.70,0:02:24.37,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.37,0:02:31.08,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.08,0:02:39.80,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.06,0:02:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}Tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.59,0:24:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
